usage: sol do files.keep --keep --path <string> [--limit <integer>] [--meta <object>] [--ratio <number>] [--json] [--dry-run] [--person ID]

Keep a folder on this device.

Arguments:
  --keep   boolean  required
  --path   string   required
  --limit  integer
  --meta   object   as JSON
  --ratio  number

Effect:   write (changes data; --dry-run shows what it would do)
Approval: never
